# Store and check out every file with LF.
#
# The header is compiled on Linux and the scripts under verify/ are executed by
# bash; a CRLF checkout turns `set -euo pipefail` into "pipefail: invalid option
# name" and breaks every one of them. core.autocrlf is a per-clone setting, so a
# repository-level attribute is the only way this tree can promise its own line
# endings instead of inheriting whatever the machine happens to have.
* text=auto eol=lf
